OL,3,GNEWSAFire-hit historic hotel's owner in
OL,4,Ademolition bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II listed hotel that was gutted
OL,7,Fby fire could be demolished after its
OL,8,Fowner applied for permission to tear
OL,9,Fdown the remains of the building in
OL,10,FWorcestershire.
OL,12,FLive Urban Two Limited submitted the
OL,13,Fapplication for Listed Building Consent
OL,14,Fafter a structural survey concluded the
OL,15,FRaven Hotel in Droitwich could not be
OL,16,Fsaved and posed a significant risk to
OL,17,Fpublic safety.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
