OL,3,GNEWSAFire-hit historic hotel's owner in
OL,4,Ademolition bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FWychavon District Council has now
OL,7,Fordered an independent inspection to
OL,8,Ftest those findings, saying demolition
OL,9,Fhas not yet been accepted as the only
OL,10,Foption.
OL,12,FIn August 2025, a blaze forced the
OL,13,Fderelict 16th Century structure to be
OL,14,Ffenced off on safety grounds.
